    "message": "[ipa-delivery:779] build the private test IPA 779 a third time: 615b1a56 promoted; RPCS3 Core 948, MeloNX Core 5924dd56, S2Arm storage fixes and the deferred Nextendo work, on base 778\n\nThe second run (44199255715) passed the preflight and failed in the Flutter kernel compile:\nmelonx_enhancement_adapter.dart:107 calls NextendoEngineSupport.containsAny, which only 615b1a56 adds, and that\ncommit was still deferred. It is now promoted, in history order, between f7b7a226 and 8946bfae. Frozen on the\ndraft commit before this one.\n\nChecked here:\n- dart analyze lib on the exported effective tree (Flutter 3.47.2): 0 errors; with the old blob, the run's error;\n- the delivery contract test (120 OK, 4 skipped) and contract 779 --offline (passed);\n- the freeze: no blocker; the trigger paths: accepted.\nNot run here: the Swift and Xcode compile.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
